{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:19 2026-06-27 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:19 2026-06-27 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:19 2026-06-27 HKT</p><p>意大利騎師艾兆禮今日停賽復岀，便立即交岀成績，先在第七場策騎蔡廄的「八仟好運」勝出，接着在第八場夥拍游廄的「顏色之皇」贏馬兼捧走皮亞士紀念挑戰盃，個人率先起孖，並在騎師王積分表以二十八分領先。</p><p>賽後練馬師游達榮說：「『顏色之皇』跑一千米好過千二米，可惜一班直路賽的賽程不多，我很希望將來有更多一班一千米讓馬兒盡展所展。『顏色之皇』下季初出將跑國慶盃，希望馬匹新一季更為成長，表現更上一層樓。」</p><h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f0da4043e4ff18e316d4b4eab3d1d62/2026-06/2e6ece12-4c35-4e65-a395-f960dd0d7426.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/823a0eb57406246a5529bffd38842162/2026-06/4ce80677-4f6d-4b49-96de-45a55263c688.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6dc5fbbb654c96d3dfd9a97104f8695e/2026-06/06fe3012-b3b3-4bd2-b1bb-e260402bc0ae.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/dca92bd28be585c980c0e2dfc861efe7/2026-06/6d6dbdba-ea95-4c08-89a9-afc052f37fed.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/75d3833400f0802bb756e95e4b94e5f9/2026-06/6eabd600-58ff-4862-b801-a71d1e9bb9ed.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2ecfa4065cebe45e9fcde8cfb4fdfff4/2026-06/07a7ec9d-9f68-4890-89d3-27c489967b85.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c1fa402fee62e80cce42d3d54c57231f/2026-06/9be10fa9-1927-49ef-9ea4-f0ea4c44e48e.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bc09501afc3425043073ac3b78b762f6/2026-06/87f5af97-b6f7-492a-97dd-2343745e4c80.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/642c255a0b959e39a26bf9bdc8fed856/2026-06/299a609a-5ff8-4d79-80a1-ff0aeee2bc09.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2c9c98690fbe93396395a4ba379f7bdd/2026-06/4897f3e4-2fd7-486d-8b2f-248a1795668a.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b484e9884fce200c6d3b90c5fe3c4161/2026-06/32519e6d-5cb7-4c9d-b8bf-a2855da5afb5.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ef8a1a67ecd3895e4df7afc3bfb0b82e/2026-06/740629e8-cbcc-4